  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fbstylia\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MineshaftsMonsters/bh_promo.png\"></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jWb8QmP/dc-logo.png\" alt=\"dc-logo\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">特色亮點...</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 數十隻首領，擁有獨特的攻擊模式與動畫</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 數百種全新動物與怪物</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 數百座全新建築</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 完整的主線任務系列與自訂任務系統</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 獨特的聲望系統</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 類魂戰鬥系統</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 超過 200 款精選模組</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7wfi9rbrGVI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kLeTRSq_mTk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">重要提示：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>- 若您決定編輯整合包，請勿移除 Dawncraft_Resources 或 Dawncraft_Datapack；否則可能會導致錯誤。</p>\n<p>- 請為 DawnCraft 分配至少 6GB 記憶體，建議配置 8-12GB。超過此範圍可能會有些過剩。</p>\n<p>- 請確保已安裝 Java 18 或 17，否則可能引發遊戲崩潰。</p>\n<p>- macOS 使用者請使用 LITE（精簡）版本，或若欲遊玩完整版請參閱此文件：<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iZ1TjJCDNyUZlEMn6S7JM_d9xQcNk2OktmxUOGdi6do/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">翻譯檔：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em><strong>2.0 更新翻譯：</strong></em></p>\n<p>西班牙語翻譯補丁請見此處：<a href=\"https://github.com/Mexes-GM/DawnCraft-Traduccion-ES\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a></p>\n<p>巴西葡萄牙語翻譯補丁（開發中）請見此處：<a href=\"https://github.com/GMalvestiti/dawncraft_lang_pt_br\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a></p>\n<p>法語翻譯補丁請見此處：<a href=\"https://github.com/fouirux/Dawncraft-French-translation/tree/main\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>[連結]</strong></a></p>\n<p>中文翻譯補丁請見此處：<a href=\"https://github.com/VM-Chinese-translate-group/dawncraft-Chinese-patch-Pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong>1.0 更新翻譯：</strong></em></p>\n<p>俄語翻譯補丁（開發中）請見此處：<a href=\"https://github.com/ItDanieru/dawncraft_lang_Uk_Be_Ru\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a></p>\n<p>西班牙語翻譯補丁（開發中）請見此處：<a href=\"https://github.com/ByAlexTTV/Dawncraft-Espanol\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a></p>\n<p>替代版俄語翻譯補丁：<a href=\"https://github.com/Skyderlock/Skyderlock-s-Dawncraft-Translation-Pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a></p>\n<p><strong>若您有興趣翻譯 DawnCraft 相關內容，可於以下路徑找到原始檔：</strong></p>\n<p>- 村民任務 (global_packs\\required_data\\DawnCraft_Datapack\\data\\quest_giver\\quests)</p>\n<p>- FTBQuest 資訊 (config\\ftbquests\\quests\\chapters)</p>\n<p>- 人類 NPC 任務 <a href=\"https://github.com/SmileycorpMC/DawnCraft-Tweaks/tree/master/src/main/resources/assets/dawncraft/lang\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a></p>\n<p>- DawnCraft Mobs 語言檔</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">創作者素材資源：</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rbhVG0HVC51ByWOecEeOb-kzTd71jY89?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">有任何問題嗎？歡迎加入我們的 Discord。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fUjPx5jzd3m\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;book antiqua&#x27;, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EuHBB1X.png\" width=\"233\" height=\"97\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">致謝與版權聲明：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>從 Savage and Ravage 使用的材質僅用於在 Epic Fight 與 Savage and Ravage 之間增加相容性。Savage and Ravage 與 Placebo 是模組「DawnCraft Mobs」載入的必要相依套件。此材質補丁僅旨在提升玩家於整合包中使用 Savage and Ravage 時的體驗。補丁前：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fPDxb92d\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a> 補丁後：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fqJWs7KF\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a> 若要查看 DawnCraft Mobs 使用的相依套件清單及新增的微調項目，請查閱「DawnCraft Mobs」的相依套件區塊。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dawncraft-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a></li>\n<li>使用的資料包：Towns &amp; Towers <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252ftowns-amp-towers-structure-overhaul%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a>、Witch Raid <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252fwitch-raids-1-18%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a></li>\n<li>未上架 CurseForge 的資源包：Skyrim Soundpack <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fsoundpack-skyrim-175%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a>、由 METAL 製作的 Improved Mounting（於 EpicFight Discord 取得）、由 ScourgeII 重新上色的 Jet and Elia's Armor（於 EpicFight Discord 取得）</li>\n<li>Epic Fight 團隊全體開發者（Yesman、Metal、RK），感謝協助解決所有 Epic Fight 相容性問題</li>\n<li>Lord Snow，感謝協助修復錯誤與提供相容性補丁</li>\n<li>Nitsu，感謝製作所有首領戰與宣傳片音樂</li>\n<li>Blackcocofish，感謝允許使用其部分生物資產</li>\n<li>brier24，感謝允許使用洞穴居民與沙龍模型！</li>\n<li>BisectHosting 團隊，感謝於首日發行時將伺服器整合包上架至其系統</li>\n<li>所有贊助者</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
